abstract: "Author-approved current documentary analysis after targeted117-dossier source checking and exact456-position B3 integration. Earlier versions and differing internal review procedures remain identified. Substantive AI preparation and author-declared source checking are disclosed. Few reconstructions are confirmed, with broad conditional uncertainty. This fixed historical corpus does not estimate clinical suicide risk or validate every historical negative."
